Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer\Nfalls, and I see the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.02,0:00:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell far behind my only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Bridery and gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.98,0:00:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.42,0:00:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But until I do, my voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.24,0:01:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next, I'm\Nwalking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.06,0:01:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go, there's nothing\Nthat can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Those times are on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.18,0:01:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.66,0:01:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.78,0:01:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me push\Nme to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.\NNo matter what, I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.34,0:01:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest of the ball can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.22,0:01:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.98,0:02:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side,\Nwe'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.92,0:02:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.92,0:02:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything will take\Nwhat I hope—you're away from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.08,0:02:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're up against him too,\Nthe legendary hero god.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.34,0:02:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't make it all the\Nway here just to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,To an old man, legends\Nain't nothing but words.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I might say the same\Nthing to you. White beard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.74,0:02:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your glory days are\Njust a dying memory now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.42,0:03:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, are you gonna\Ndestroy this entire city?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Send me the bill for\Nrepairs when we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.82,0:03:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pushing toward the scavenger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.42,0:03:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ironic, I know, but I\Nforgot about those things.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No more lasers for today. That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think we were weak, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're from the new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.50,0:03:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.10,0:03:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the scaffold!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.06,0:04:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A final moment of regret?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.94,0:04:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gold Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.76,0:04:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course I know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But who gives a crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.38,0:04:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,People talk like he's something\Nspecial, but what did he even do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He just riled up a bunch of criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to that bastard,\Nthe entire world is screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.04,0:04:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way you're that stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows before he was executed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.16,0:04:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,he told some BS story\Nabout hidden treasure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,to give the middle\Nfinger to the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.06,0:04:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.18,0:04:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,it worked,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:50.11,Default,,0,0,0,,because a bunch of dumb pirates bought\Ninto the whole thing and went nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.18,0:04:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He left behind a stain\Npeople still can't clean up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.98,0:04:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Even killing the bastard wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.46,0:04:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, thanks to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,we gotta put up with a\Nbunch of human garbage
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.28,0:05:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,pissing on everyone\Nelse following his lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the biggest piece\Nof crap who ever lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.00,0:05:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He stinks even after we flushed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.58,0:05:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.86,0:05:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, did I hurt your little feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you in the Roger fan club?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You got something you want to say, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You start in trouble again, Ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.22,0:05:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's making a fuss about some thugs\Nthat got beat near to death by a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.94,0:05:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too bad. I was\Nhoping they would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.88,0:05:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't give me that. You\Nrealize when you pull this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of crap I'm the one\Nwho gets chewed out for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.44,0:05:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.30,0:06:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly I don't know what that old fool
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,was thinking leaving a\Nboy like you with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What you want me to tell you about Roger?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He was
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.52,0:06:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,a liar
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.43,0:06:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and a murderer
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.44,0:06:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and a miserable thief to boot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Only jackasses believe his crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,King of the pirates king of the chumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.73,0:06:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.10,0:06:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger? Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to enjoy a drink over here kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The man was a hack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.76,0:06:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now piss off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me? Beat it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're\Ndoing, you little punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.44,0:06:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I should see the other guy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.76,0:07:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't keep doing this, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So your grandson
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's around my age, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.52,0:07:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think he's happy with himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.74,0:07:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, I think he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.80,0:07:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The boy's growing up in fine feather.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man. Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I deserve to be born\Nor was it just a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not for me to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You just keep living\Nand hope you find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick carry straw boy back to the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not ideal, but we'll have\Nto save Ace Boy without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.06,0:08:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Eva
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.34,0:08:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I need one last favor from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're coming for you, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.86,0:08:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.44,0:08:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And Amy never stood a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.26,0:08:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My friend, don't lose hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear, I shall save your life no\Nmatter how much blood it's filled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.48,0:08:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no stopping us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.42,0:08:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them get you down, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.82,0:08:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we won't leave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're brothers, we stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.80,0:09:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, this is all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell am I supposed to feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.06,0:09:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops, Luffy, my friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.86,0:09:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're here to save me, but!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.80,0:09:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They're pushing through a sea\Nof their own blood to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.74,0:09:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say one last thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.86,0:09:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're getting out of here alive, darn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.80,0:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what I need?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,These are tears of joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.60,0:09:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after all I've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.68,0:09:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.54,0:09:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Buggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.26,0:09:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, jeez, what happened? We okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Aokiji just froze you solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.52,0:09:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It was really freaky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.50,0:10:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.72,0:10:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear that, Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Buggy's coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.58,0:10:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No walls, eyes, or giant magma\Nfists can stop me. Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.40,0:10:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've only been defrosted\Nlike a couple of minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're like BAM let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.62,0:10:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how I roll
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.08,0:10:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, seriously now what\Nbetter move my punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.94,0:10:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Son of a
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.40,0:10:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The ravages of time humble us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.16,0:10:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.24,0:10:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.12,0:10:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I was afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.78,0:11:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want no sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.54,0:11:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm wearing this\Ncrap in front of my enemies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.42,0:11:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't turn your back\Non me if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.06,0:11:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna make the same mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.86,0:11:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone has to see you off and that\Nduty seems to have fallen on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Pops, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, got good. Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.86,0:11:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Another hormone shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.70,0:11:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're past your limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.00,0:12:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, kid, but you've been burning\Nyour candle at both ends for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.16,0:12:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten that\Npoison you suffered through?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.04,0:12:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You cheated death once.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't save you so you\Ncould destroy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you this last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My hormones aren't a magic fix-me-up you\Ncan take every time something goes wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to save Ace Boy, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you keep misusing my\Npower like this, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I do everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.20,0:12:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, you have to let me fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.90,0:12:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, I think Pops is down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.84,0:12:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Marco, Geoise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.54,0:12:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.80,0:13:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And they kill Ace because\NI wasn't there for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.92,0:13:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'd rather be dead anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.70,0:13:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How is the only fight\Nthat matters? Live or die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.66,0:13:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You dummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.72,0:13:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever would I tell your dear old dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.72,0:13:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, if I let you die like a dog\Ndue to my deadly Devil Fruit power?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.36,0:13:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This stubbornness of\Nyours is not cute at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.28,0:13:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh fine, it's your life\Ngive us a good show
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.12,0:14:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.14,0:14:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.26,0:14:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Kizaru hit him dead on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.66,0:14:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle he's even alive, let\Nalone getting up and screaming like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.22,0:14:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.54,0:14:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Straw Boy, energy\Nhormone may get you pumped for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.72,0:14:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you fall again, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a dead boy. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, it's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.32,0:14:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not executing Ace while I'm around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The kid's crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.96,0:14:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but it isn't like he's going to change\Nhis mind under these circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:15:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I might as well give\Nhim some backup then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.44,0:15:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Straw Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.36,0:15:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He was coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.06,0:15:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.46,0:15:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not for long, he's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.76,0:15:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish him off!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.80,0:15:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.42,0:15:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not taking another step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.34,0:15:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got you surrounded now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's right, there's no\Nway you can defeat all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.36,0:15:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The navy always wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.76,0:15:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Incoming!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.08,0:15:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:15:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.88,0:16:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My, what a fanciful strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.12,0:16:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Eva, I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.88,0:16:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kobe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.54,0:16:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If I want any hope of\Ngrowing stronger as a Marine,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to fight all enemies,\Nno matter who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.36,0:16:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Luffy, but I'm\Ngonna have to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.10,0:16:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now save!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I got carried away again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.16,0:17:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm useless after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.68,0:17:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's back to the truck, Bart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.02,0:17:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Those dirty frauds\Nimpersonating my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey D. Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't they just move?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.78,0:17:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Boa Hancock, one of the seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.66,0:17:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Navy ally detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ceasing attack. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.74,0:18:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.84,0:18:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the pirate, Empress?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.58,0:18:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you two got a thing\Ngoing on I should know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He said my name, and he didn't\Nget it wrong. Please move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You are standing in the\Nway I never gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.04,0:18:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,permission to address me in such a matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Pops, coming to save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It went straight through.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just try and stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.98,0:18:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that certainly throws\Na wrinkle into my plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.98,0:18:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Regeneration, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So that must be why they\Ncall you the Phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give me a hand, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea Prism Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.60,0:19:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it hurt that time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They got Geoise too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's frozen solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.66,0:19:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's two commanders down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.82,0:19:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Take out the head and\Nthe body will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.86,0:19:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.76,0:19:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold still, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.22,0:19:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool, I will not be chained.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.96,0:19:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, now close in fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Against the others and attack\Nquite big with all you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No, stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You punks really think that's\Nall it takes to defeat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.48,0:20:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a few toy swords and guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.26,0:20:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I could tear you all apart single-handedly,\Nbut you know that, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you quake when you\Nhear the name Whitebeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.36,0:21:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.60,0:21:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,no, no, no, no,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,no,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.74,0:21:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.42,0:21:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not such a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.84,0:22:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what will happen if\NI falter, even for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen if I die?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.92,0:22:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And knowing that cold truth
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.18,0:22:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't allow myself to submit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.80,0:22:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not until the bitter end
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.86,0:22:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll wait until I've taken\Ncare of the future for my sons?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.10,0:22:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it, Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.50,0:22:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, old fools lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.08,0:22:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.66,0:23:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, and we were so close, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.36,0:23:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastards have formed a barrier\Naround Whitebeard's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You want us to bury you with the old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mockery does not sway my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.24,0:23:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It is our pride and our\Njoy to stand beside him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.22,0:23:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You bunch of fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.12,0:23:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.14,0:23:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Concerned about the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.56,0:23:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be more than happy\Nto show it to you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.12,0:23:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.70,0:23:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.48,0:23:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.36,0:23:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm too slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.62,0:23:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.74,0:23:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I can't stop\Nthose ruts from doing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.26,0:23:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,From the start, this was the only way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.98,0:24:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.76,0:24:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.30,0:24:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.08,0:25:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.70,0:25:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just do what I think you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.12,0:25:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Conqueror's spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.46,0:25:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.94,0:25:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.52,0:25:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.20,0:25:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why that little brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.26,0:25:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,AAAAAAHHHHHHHHHH!
